# PANELFIX result

Both development scoring panels are delivered and pass the unmodified real scorer against a matching real epoch-500 checkpoint. This work restores the ability to score. It performs no separate EE analysis, quotes or interprets no EE value, and makes no claim about any route. The mandatory scorer emitted its normal scored result only as an execution/contract acceptance test.

These are development materials. `EVALPATH-2026-09-10` leaves global evaluator-path authority **UNDETERMINED**, so neither panel nor anything scored on it is claim-grade.

