  .scratch/eval-path/run_forensics.py
```

The completed run used one Python process, exited 0, serialized 224 rows, and took 682.17 s. JSON validation passed. The two directly relevant existing regressions also passed under the mandated interpreter:

```text
tests/physics_v025/test_stage4d_gate.py::test_committed_48_boundary_trajectories_match_scalar_resolution
tests/physics_v025/test_stage4d_gate.py::test_dense_and_scalar_evaluation_enter_through_common_resolver
2 passed
